Package: cgiarGenomics
Type: Package
Title: Reading, Quality Control and Imputation of SNP Marker Data
Version: 1.0.2
Date: 2026-11-25
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Sergio Andres", family = "Cruz",
           email = "s.cruz@cgiar.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reads bi-allelic SNP marker data from hapmap, VCF, DArTSeq and
    DArTag files for diploid and polyploid crops, and converts them to allele
    dosages in an 'adegenet' genlight object. Provides quality metrics,
    sequential filtering of loci and individuals, imputation by allele
    frequency, Random Forest or 'Beagle', merging of replicate samples,
    identity-by-state and Mendelian checks, and export to VCF. It is the
    genomic data engine of Bioflow, the CGIAR breeding analytics pipeline.
URL: https://github.com/Breeding-Analytics/cgiarGenomics
BugReports: https://github.com/Breeding-Analytics/cgiarGenomics/issues
